.Dd August 9, 2026
.Dt VV 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vv
.Nd print a tool version as a strict SemVer triple
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar tool
.Pp
.Nm
.Fl vv
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints exactly one
.Li X.Y.Z
line for
.Ar tool .
Missing or unparseable versions produce
.Li 0.0.0 .
The exit status is always zero.
.Pp
Lookup order is a valid upstream
.Fl vv
response, a trusted recipe, then
.Ar tool
.Fl -version .
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl vv , Fl -version
Print the
.Nm
version.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Print brief help.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width VV_RECIPES
.It Ev VV_RECIPES
Recipe directory override.
.It Ev VV_TIMEOUT
Probe timeout in seconds. Default: 5.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
The utility exits zero for every normal result, including missing or
unparseable tools. A non-zero status indicates a defect in
.Nm .
